#!/usr/bin/env etcs
# One of the fire's meshes, empty: the battle bakes into it a part of one of
# its trees of fire -- a tree's hottest steps, its middling, or its ends -- and
# a burst's shell is drawn with it (KartBattle.h, a burst). Remade when the
# trees are: a session's opening, and each round. A child of the world, since
# a shape is named by where it is (Scene3D::SetMesh).
#   run kart_fire_mesh.etcs world=<Scene3D> battle=<KartBattle>
requires world [Drawable3D]
requires battle [KartBattle]
world.spawn(RenderProvider::Mesh fire)
fire.Create()
battle.AddFireMesh(@fire)
